      "content": "that \"competitive advantage\" thing sounds a bit idealistic to me lol. most of us are just trying to keep the lights on. it feels like the regulations are being driven by people who don't actually understand the math of a small business. isn't it true that the environmental benefits of these specific mandates for small shops are basically negligible compared to the actual economic damage they cause?",
